      "source": "The `step(``displayLink:)` function attempts to sum the square roots of all numbers up to [`max`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/Int/max), but with each iteration checks the current time ([`CACurrentMediaTime()`](cacurrentmediatime().md)) against the [`targetTimestamp`](cadisplaylink/targettimestamp.md).",
      "normalizedSource": "The `step(``displayLink:)` function attempts to sum the square roots of all numbers up to [`max`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/Int/max), but with each iteration checks the current time ([`CACurrentMediaTime()`](cacurrentmediatime().md)) against the [`targetTimestamp`](cadisplaylink/targettimestamp.md).",
